    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Discover the charm and convenience of “Bayview”, Kilbride, Arklow, nestled in a highly sought-after location, built in c. 1972 situated on the Kilbride Road, just 0.5 km off the R772 Dublin Road, and 2 km North of Arklow town centre with easy access onto the motorway Exit 20 Arklow North Templerainey within minutes drive to Templerainey school, churches, Bridgewater Shopping Centre, Bay Hotel North Beach and town centre with all town amenities close to hand."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\n1.43m x 1.01m\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n3.95m x 3.50m\r\nNice bright room with open fire, tiled fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Room\r\n5.33m x 4.38m\r\nFitted kitchen units, single drainer unit, airing cupboard and dual immersion heater.\r\nOpen fire with back boiler, T.V. and telephone points.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n2.07m x 1.51m\r\nTiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n4.29m x 3.06m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.96m x 3.49m\r\n(Access to bathroom)\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.83m x 2.31m\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.60m x 2.13m\r\nComprising, bath, shower cubicle with Triton electric shower, w.c., w.h.b.\r\nTiled floor and part tiled walls.\r\n\r\nResidential Area\r\n(Internal Floor) c. 74.33m² (c. 800ft²)\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nNeat front walled in garden in lawn incorporating tarmac drive and parking. Access to rear private garden in lawn and vegetable plot; mature trees around the perimeter offering maximum privacy. Beautiful views of the countryside.\r\n\r\nGarage\r\n5.87m x 2.60m\r\nUp and over door, electricity service connected, shelved and sink unit.\r\n\r\nServices\r\nMains electricity and water, septic tank drainage. Dual central heating, oil fired and back boiler.\r\n\r\nTitle\r\nFreehold\r\n\r\nBER No. 106549678"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tLovely private rear garden not overlooked\r\n•\tBoundaries clearly defined \r\n•\tClose to all town amenities \r\n•\tBreath-taking views of the country side"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: F"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Arklow travel up Dublin Road taking a left at former Behan’s Garage, sign posted for Avoca. Immediately after this turn take the next left, continue straight, property is right hand side marked by our sale board."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Please phone for appointment (0402) 32911 Office Hours 9am to 5pm Monday to Friday."
      }
